Game controllers: PlayStation and Nintendo pads through SDL as XInput pads (NEUTRON_PAD_HIDRAW=1
keeps raw HID), IOHID pads kept when libSDL2 is missing, XInput rumble held until changed,
XInput battery wired/full, Home/Share buttons of pads to the game instead of macOS gestures
(NEUTRON_PAD_SYSTEM_GESTURES=1 keeps them), NEUTRON_PAD_VIRTUAL test pad in winebus.
The winemac parts in macdrv_cocoa.h and macdrv_main.c are in 0010, Makefile.in in 0014.
