+/*
+ * MACDRV game controller system gestures
+ *
+ * neutron: games read pads in winedevice (winebus through SDL), a background
+ * process. macOS binds the Home/PS button (Launchpad, Game Overlay) and the
+ * Share/Create button (screenshot, recording) of a pad to system gestures and
+ * applies them for the frontmost app, which is the game's Wine process. So this
+ * process asks GameController to leave those buttons to the game, like a native
+ * game would. NEUTRON_PAD_SYSTEM_GESTURES=1 keeps the macOS gestures.
+ *
